::Linked. [[User:FunkMonk|FunkMonk]] ([[User talk:FunkMonk|talk]]) 16:14, 3 October 2016 (UTC)
* ''genus of theropod dinosaur'' &mdash; is this a typo or a hunters' plural as in "I killed three lion, six tiger and two gigantosaur"?
::It is supposed to be singular. Like "is a genus of psittacine parrot", or some such... [[User:FunkMonk|FunkMonk]] ([[User talk:FunkMonk|talk]]) 16:1
